    "reviewContext": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Invoke the stable-contract gate from CI**\n\nBecause this new pipeline is `runIfOnlySpecified`, and neither `.github/workflows/*.yml` nor `eng/release-protocol.json` invokes it, the committed 468-member proof index is never validated by the required tooling or release workflows. The ordinary test step only exercises synthetic `validateProofIndex` fixtures, so a stale source hash, missing runtime receipt, or broken real index can still pass every release context; add this pipeline to an enforced workflow or release-protocol step.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L7-L9](https://github.com/wxxb789/funnysharp/blob/401ec94d8310756afdca77d4890250b4a9a71e59/AGENTS.md#L7-L9)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
